secubox-metrics (1.0.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Fix crash-loop after reboot (#149): CACHE_DIR moves from /tmp/secubox
    to /var/cache/secubox. /tmp is cleared on reboot, breaking the systemd
    ReadWritePaths namespace setup and producing status=226/NAMESPACE.
  * Use systemd CacheDirectory=secubox so the directory is auto-managed
    with the service user/group and survives reboots.
  * Drop /tmp/secubox from postinst.
  * Closes: #149

